<title>USA: MFB Corp Q4 Sept 30 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>MFB Corp Q4 Sept 30 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>MISHAWAKA, Ind. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.10   profit	 $0.12</p>
<p> Net loss		     197   profit	   239</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1996 results were reduced by a one-time special assessment of $577,000 or $0.29/shr after-tax to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund. Had the charge not occurred, 1996 Q4 results would have been net income of about $380,000 or $0.20/shr.  </p>
<p>			 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.48   profit	 $0.59</p>
<p> Net profit		   975   profit	 1,236</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Had the special SAIF assessment not occurred, net for the FY96 full year would have been $1.6 million or $0.76/shr.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
